                            <comment id="17451886" author="tledkov-gridgain" created="Wed, 1 Dec 2021 15:14:00 +0000"  >&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;Why do we want to declare query field as object in the first place?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
