Also, for the case when the field may contain two different types of BinObj?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;My point: we have to skip check the type inheritance when the type is user-created binary type.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;tt&gt;BinaryObject&lt;/tt&gt; and the ability to use it instead of the read user classes is a public API of the Ignite. So we have to support it.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
